# MX Bikes Shop catalog credential.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the values the store's developer
# gave you. NEVER put real values in this file — it is tracked in git.
#
# The store authenticates with a single custom header: `MXB_SHOP_API_HEADER` is the header
# *name* and `MXB_SHOP_API_KEY` is its value, e.g.
#
#     X-Frostmod-Key: <the key>
#
# `src-tauri/build.rs` reads `.env.local` at compile time and bakes the values into the Rust
# binary — they are never exposed to the webview.
#
# Building without these is fine and supported: the app simply hides its Shop tab.
# Official releases get the same values from the MXB_SHOP_API_HEADER / MXB_SHOP_API_KEY
# repository secrets (see .github/workflows/release.yml).

MXB_SHOP_API_HEADER=
MXB_SHOP_API_KEY=
